{"product_id":"white-eclipse-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"White Eclipse – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Elite Cue","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eElegant, striking, and defined by sophisticated contrast, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhite Eclipse\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together the natural beauty of premium curly maple with refined ivory detailing, dark accents, and the iridescent brilliance of abalone.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe flowing figure of the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium curly maple\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e creates a naturally dynamic foundation, enhanced by meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eplastic ivory and abalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. The geometric pattern creates a distinctive eclipse-inspired aesthetic, where bright elements meet darker accents to produce depth, movement, and visual balance throughout the cue.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe design continues through the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ebutt sleeve\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e with matching handcrafted inlay work and carefully placed abalone accents. Complementing the overall design are \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ehandcrafted abalone rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, adding subtle flashes of natural color while creating elegant transitions between each section of the cue.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA premium \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLuxe wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides the handle with a sophisticated, comfortable finish while creating a striking contrast against the lighter curly maple. The precision \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e completes the construction with a secure and dependable connection between the butt and shaft.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors who appreciate refined design with distinctive character, the White Eclipse embodies the perfect balance of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003enatural wood, bold contrast, and handcrafted artistry\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Curly Maple\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Plastic Ivory \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Luxe Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/spa